OL,3,GNEWSALaser attacks may lead to
OL,4,A'catastrophe', pilot says
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Air Ambulance's chief pilot
OL,7,Fis warning of the dangers of pointing
OL,8,Flasers at helicopters, with the attacks
OL,9,Fdelaying patient care "on a number of
OL,10,Foccasions".
OL,12,FAccording to UK Civil Aviation
OL,13,FAuthority (CAA) figures, there have
OL,14,Fbeen eight laser attacks on emergency
OL,15,Fhelicopters in Yorkshire so far this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,F"If there's a laser in the location
OL,19,Fwhere we want to land, we just can't,"
OL,20,Fsaid Owen McTeggart, from the Yorkshire
OL,21,FAir Ambulance.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
