OL,3,GNEWSALaser attacks may lead to
OL,4,A'catastrophe', pilot says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarking Air Ambulance Week, the CAA and
OL,7,FYorkshire Air Ambulance are calling for
OL,8,Fthese attacks, which can distract the
OL,9,Fpilot and cause permanent eye damage,
OL,10,Fto stop.
